    "settings-ui",
    "webview-browser-smokes",
    "webview-generated-inventories"
  ],
  "behavior_before": "Settings markup, run-monitor normalization/formatting/rendering/interaction logic, and Settings builder component styles are each concentrated in a single large parent file.",
  "behavior_after": "The same browser-visible behavior and backend contracts are composed from smaller domain-owned markup, JavaScript, and CSS slices; parent files retain stable orchestration/public entry points.",
